xpenseLine- Global#ExpenseLine - setRecurring\\(Boolean recurring\\)":[130,143],"#ExpenseLine- Global#ExpenseLine - setRecurring\\(Boolean recurring\\)#{1}":[132,143],"#ExpenseLine- Global#ExpenseLine - setSummaryType\\(String summaryType\\)":[144,166],"#ExpenseLine- Global#ExpenseLine - setSummaryType\\(String summaryType\\)#{1}":[146,166]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Server API reference","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/api-server.md","line":28}],"metadata":{"title":"ExpenseLine - Global","description":"The ExpenseLine script include is used by various cost management processes and can also be used for generating expense line \\(fm\\_expense\\_line\\) records from your own server-side scripts.Constructor for ExpenseLine object.Creates a new expense line record.Used internally by the createExpense method to process CI relationships when the expense source is a cmdb\\_ci record.Identifies the source rate card or distribution cost that was the source of expense line generation.Defines the description of an expense.Sets the parent field on the expense line.Flags the expense as recurring by setting the recurring field to true.Sets a value for the expense line summary\\_type field.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/api-reference/server-api-reference/c\\_ExpenseLineAPI.html","release":"australia","product":"Server API Reference","classification":"server-api-reference","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":2,"breadcrumb":["Server API reference","API reference","API implementation and reference"],"tags":["#api-reference","#glidesystem","#gliderecord","#server-side","#glide","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[44,52],[66,76],[156,164]],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/api-reference/server-api-reference/c_ExpenseLineAPI.md"},
